	"Description": "How to use the AT mode: download and extract it to the mod folder, install the front AT, then buy the paint bucket at Robin's store, select the paint bucket, and left click the lamp to change the texture\n<br />Replacement lamps\n<br />Box\u00A0Lamp,Candle\u00A0Lamp,Classic\u00A0Lamp,Country\u00A0Lamp,Modern\u00A0Lamp,Ornate\u00A0Lamp\n<br />\n<br />Dynamic Game Assets:Unzip to the Mods folder and then purchase from Robin's store\n<br />\n<br />How to use CF mode：\n<br />The front-end furniture is required, and the mobile version uses version 0.11.2；\n<br />You can buy it in Robin or furniture catalogIf you need to uninstall this module；\n<br />Delete the furniture in the game first, otherwise the smapi will appear an error report when you restart。\n<br />\n<br />AT模式的使用方法:下载解压到mod文件夹，装好前置AT，然后到罗宾的商店购买油漆桶，选中油漆桶左键点击灯具更换纹理\n<br />替换的灯具有:乡村台灯，箱式台灯，现代台灯，经典台灯，蜡烛灯，华丽灯\n<br />\n<br />DGA的使用方法：解压到Mods文件夹，在罗宾的商店购买\n<br />\n<br />CF家具的使用\n<br />在罗宾或者家具目录里购买家具\n<br />卸载此模组前，得先把游戏内的模组家具删掉，否则再启动smapi会报错。",
